  "details": "However, it works as you'd expect if you do it while standing.\n\nTo reproduce: Crouch, jump while still, try to move midair. You will appear to be locked in place and unable to move until you contact with the ground again.\n\nI've made sure it's not just me or any particular world, it's global and affects everyone.\n\nThis is something I noticed in the latest live update, not sure if its been around longer by chance. Either way, I don't figure this is intended behavior, but correct me if I'm wrong.\n\nThanks.",
